  "notes": "{抜|ぬ}く is a transitive godan verb with multiple meanings.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {抜|ぬ}く (transitive): to pull out\n- ⟦{抜|ぬ}ける→抜ける：02385_nukeru⟧ (intransitive): to come out, fall out\n\nMEANINGS AND EXAMPLES:\n1. Extract: ⟦{歯|は}→歯：00778_ha⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{抜|ぬ}く (pull a tooth), ⟦{草|くさ}→草：02206_kusa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{抜|ぬ}く (pull weeds)\n2. Omit: ⟦{食事|しょくじ}→食事：02087_shokuji⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{抜|ぬ}く (skip a meal)\n3. Surpass: ⟦{記録|きろく}→記録：02490_kiroku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{抜|ぬ}く (break a record)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{抜|ぬ}く: to cut corners, slack off\n- ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{抜|ぬ}く: to let one's guard down\n- ⟦{群|ぐん}→群：02790_gun⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{抜|ぬ}く: to stand out from the crowd\n- ⟦{骨|ほね}→骨：02166_hone⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{抜|ぬ}く: to take the backbone out (weaken)",
